    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1664">

                <pb facs="1060" n="944" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg944"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.00/2364.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Jefferson.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 14, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your November 10. Department is to-day telegraphing American Consul Bluefields:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Please warn all Americans that this Government will not countenance
                            insurrection and that Americans interfering with the Government do so at
                            their own peril.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
